WEBVTT

01:40.740 --> 01:44.280
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.160 --> 01:47.250
[Episode 9]

02:04.150 --> 02:04.950
Hello.

02:06.590 --> 02:07.940
Have you bought the ticket?

02:09.910 --> 02:12.510
Are you still planning to buy one?

02:12.830 --> 02:13.620
Yes.

02:18.870 --> 02:20.030
I'm not a bad person.

02:20.070 --> 02:21.620
I'm just here to find someone.

02:25.500 --> 02:27.300
You won't report me, will you?

02:29.940 --> 02:30.740
Really?

02:37.390 --> 02:38.380
My name is Tanyin.

02:38.940 --> 02:40.579
I'm your fellow villager and neighbor.

02:40.950 --> 02:42.079
We're good friends,

02:42.400 --> 02:43.510
the best kind.

02:44.990 --> 02:46.220
You're Tanyin,

02:46.390 --> 02:48.270
my fellow villager and neighbor.

02:48.270 --> 02:49.510
We're good friends,

02:49.710 --> 02:50.950
the best kind.

02:52.710 --> 02:53.510
Xue,

02:55.390 --> 02:56.630
this is my hometown friend Tanyin,

02:56.630 --> 02:58.180
a good friend I grew up with,

02:58.240 --> 02:59.270
the best kind.

03:01.550 --> 03:02.350
Here.

03:04.590 --> 03:05.630
Take a look.

03:06.140 --> 03:06.950
How is it?

03:09.830 --> 03:10.630
It's pretty good, right?

03:12.630 --> 03:13.870
From now on,

03:13.990 --> 03:15.270
you can stay at my place.

03:17.470 --> 03:18.670
No need to trouble you.

03:20.270 --> 03:22.310
How can you say that?

03:22.880 --> 03:24.310
We're good friends,

03:24.350 --> 03:25.790
the best kind.

03:25.950 --> 03:27.190
Since we've met,

03:27.190 --> 03:28.590
there's no reason for you to leave.

03:28.990 --> 03:29.790
Just listen to me

03:29.829 --> 03:30.780
and stay here.

03:42.230 --> 03:43.870
It's you who killed Ji Tanyin,

03:43.910 --> 03:45.790
but why am I the one getting the bad luck?

03:47.790 --> 03:49.550
My misfortune is your misfortune.

03:50.070 --> 03:51.310
What's the difference?

03:53.190 --> 03:53.990
Luckily,

03:54.110 --> 03:55.190
I was prepared.

04:01.280 --> 04:01.950
Wait,

04:02.390 --> 04:03.510
how did it get lost too?

04:06.390 --> 04:07.190
Yuanzhong,

04:07.550 --> 04:08.590
I told you before that

04:08.590 --> 04:09.550
Ji Tanyin could

04:09.550 --> 04:11.030
being able to survive under the Divine Left Hand

04:11.030 --> 04:12.400
means her bloodline is not ordinary.

04:12.980 --> 04:14.770
The War Demon was once a member of the divine race.

04:15.110 --> 04:16.110
Killing her

04:16.149 --> 04:17.740
is like killing a god.

04:17.980 --> 04:19.779
There's always a price for that.

04:19.800 --> 04:20.870
The War Demon was already

04:20.870 --> 04:21.910
exiled from the Divine Realm.

04:21.910 --> 04:23.430
What kind of divine race is that?

04:24.150 --> 04:24.950
Don't worry.

04:25.540 --> 04:26.700
It'll be fine after a while.

04:27.630 --> 04:28.950
After the Battle of Pinghu back then,

04:28.950 --> 04:30.470
you were unlucky for many years.

04:31.590 --> 04:32.390
Many War Demons

04:32.390 --> 04:33.670
died in the Battle of Pinghu.

04:34.150 --> 04:35.350
How can Ji Tanyin alone

04:35.350 --> 04:36.750
be compared to them?

04:36.780 --> 04:37.980
That's different.

04:38.550 --> 04:40.430
This divine retribution has struck with overwhelming force.

04:41.030 --> 04:42.870
You'd better do some good deeds

04:42.930 --> 04:43.980
and build up some merit

04:44.100 --> 04:45.190
to lessen the consequences.

04:47.390 --> 04:48.230
Where are you going?

04:48.310 --> 04:49.110
To make some money.

04:55.390 --> 04:56.190
Accountant Liu,

04:56.230 --> 04:57.310
can you read this for me?

04:57.310 --> 04:57.950
It's a letter

04:57.950 --> 04:58.990
from my little brother.

04:59.190 --> 05:00.950
I've got a lot to do here,

05:00.950 --> 05:01.630
let's do it tomorrow.

05:01.630 --> 05:02.310
You said yesterday

05:02.310 --> 05:03.310
that you'd read it to me today.

05:03.310 --> 05:04.070
Tomorrow.

05:07.830 --> 05:08.630
Come here.

05:08.790 --> 05:09.550
I?

05:09.550 --> 05:10.510
Yes, come here.

05:12.830 --> 05:13.680
Let me read it for you.

05:14.310 --> 05:15.420
This... This is too much trouble.

05:15.420 --> 05:16.260
It's no trouble.

05:23.990 --> 05:25.190
Greetings, elder brother.

05:25.670 --> 05:26.710
It's been months since we last met,

05:27.110 --> 05:28.180
and I miss you very much.

05:28.790 --> 05:30.270
Everything at home is as usual.

05:30.870 --> 05:32.470
Our parents are in good health.

05:33.010 --> 05:34.560
Little sister has grown taller.

05:35.110 --> 05:37.310
Uncle Hui's tailoring shop is expanding,

05:37.950 --> 05:39.390
and he took me on as an apprentice.

05:40.110 --> 05:41.909
I'll work hard to learn the craft

05:41.930 --> 05:43.860
and take care of father, mother, and little sister.

05:44.159 --> 05:45.950
Brother, don't worry.

05:46.330 --> 05:48.790
The old yellow dog at home is getting old...

06:46.950 --> 06:48.190
I'm going to work now.

06:48.190 --> 06:49.630
Stay in the room and don't wander around.

06:49.909 --> 06:50.790
You don't have a ticket,

06:50.790 --> 06:51.990
and you might get caught.

06:52.390 --> 06:53.909
I'll go buy a ticket later.

06:54.950 --> 06:55.630
With me around,

06:55.630 --> 06:57.350
why waste your money on that?

06:57.390 --> 06:58.230
Be good, okay?

06:58.270 --> 06:59.590
I'll bring you something tasty when I come back.

06:59.980 --> 07:00.790
I'm off.

07:22.260 --> 07:23.070
Grandpa,

07:23.430 --> 07:25.910
is the Grudge Bird fiercer than an eagle?

07:27.630 --> 07:29.470
If you really compare them,

07:29.470 --> 07:30.310
the eagle

07:30.310 --> 07:32.430
is like a little bunny—so gentle.

07:32.470 --> 07:33.390
It's no match

07:33.390 --> 07:35.430
for the Grudge Bird.

07:36.159 --> 07:37.630
That sounds so impressive.

07:37.630 --> 07:39.030
I'd love to have one.

07:40.430 --> 07:42.670
The Grudge Bird, according to legends,

07:42.670 --> 07:44.030
is formed from the resentment

07:44.030 --> 07:45.150
on the Pinghu battlefield.

07:45.180 --> 07:47.220
It's the embodiment of the dead War Demon.

07:47.510 --> 07:49.030
It's not so easy to tame.

07:49.070 --> 07:50.990
If it smells blood,

07:50.990 --> 07:52.070
it'll swoop down

07:52.070 --> 07:53.110
and eat us both,

07:53.110 --> 07:54.750
leaving nothing but bone fragments.

07:54.750 --> 07:55.630
I'm not afraid.

07:55.630 --> 07:57.510
We have the craftsman uncle on the ship.

07:57.510 --> 07:59.909
Mom said that our clan's craftsmanship is the best—

07:59.909 --> 08:01.430
we'll definitely be able to kill them.

08:02.870 --> 08:03.710
It's not that easy.

08:04.110 --> 08:05.630
It's said that the Grudge Bird

08:05.630 --> 08:06.990
is over a person tall,

08:06.990 --> 08:08.030
fast,

08:08.030 --> 08:09.550
and tough.

08:09.630 --> 08:11.220
They're really hard to kill.

08:13.070 --> 08:14.910
Its body may be tough,

08:15.190 --> 08:16.910
but its head is extremely soft.

08:17.030 --> 08:18.460
If you attack its head,

08:18.590 --> 08:19.870
you can kill it.

08:20.150 --> 08:21.910
Moreover, Grudge Birds are not

08:21.910 --> 08:23.510
the transformed spirits of the deceased War Demons.

08:23.590 --> 08:25.190
Instead, they are ordinary birds

08:25.310 --> 08:26.710
that accidentally consumed the dense, lingering death energy

08:26.710 --> 08:28.620
left after the Battle of Pinghu,

08:28.750 --> 08:29.990
which turned them into what people now call

08:29.990 --> 08:30.790
Grudge Bird.

08:32.950 --> 08:34.470
I've learned something today.

08:38.470 --> 08:40.110
Father, it's easy to catch a cold out here.

08:40.110 --> 08:41.380
Why are you out here again?

08:44.550 --> 08:46.190
The scenery is so beautiful...

08:46.310 --> 08:48.510
I won't get to see much more of it.

08:48.710 --> 08:50.470
Father, you're talking nonsense again.

08:51.150 --> 08:52.310
Let's go back.

08:52.310 --> 08:52.960
Alright.

08:53.140 --> 08:54.260
Grandson, let's go.

09:01.320 --> 09:02.430
Let me help you pick those up.

09:15.840 --> 09:17.710
I'm sorry.

09:17.710 --> 09:18.430
I'm sorry.

09:21.120 --> 09:21.950
Never mind.

09:26.350 --> 09:27.150
Here you are.

09:27.350 --> 09:28.350
Thank you, Sir.

09:28.600 --> 09:29.710
Thank you, Sir.

09:30.630 --> 09:31.430
Let's go.

09:34.550 --> 09:35.670
It's not that simple, huh?

09:35.670 --> 09:37.030
You've run into such bad luck.

09:37.270 --> 09:38.310
Could it be that Ji Tanyin is

09:38.310 --> 09:40.070
the daughter of the leader of the War Demons?

09:40.710 --> 09:42.590
I've even killed the leader of the War Demon before;

09:42.590 --> 09:43.870
why would I be afraid of his daughter?

09:44.540 --> 09:46.190
You'd better do some good deeds

09:46.190 --> 09:47.200
to balance the backlash.

10:15.020 --> 10:15.990
The guards on the tower ship

10:15.990 --> 10:17.190
are looking for you,

10:17.240 --> 10:18.270
aren't they?

10:18.870 --> 10:20.670
My men are waiting for me to return.

10:21.270 --> 10:22.080
If they realize

10:22.080 --> 10:23.380
I've been gone too long,

10:23.410 --> 10:24.850
they'll definitely come looking.

10:25.030 --> 10:27.990
You won't be able to run then.

10:28.240 --> 10:29.180
By then,

10:30.150 --> 10:31.350
I'll kill you first.

10:37.110 --> 10:38.310
Young man,

10:38.830 --> 10:40.830
we have no conflict.

10:41.230 --> 10:42.670
There's no need for this, right?

10:43.110 --> 10:44.030
What are your conditions?

10:44.030 --> 10:45.230
What's in here?

10:46.190 --> 10:47.030
I'm not sure.

10:47.540 --> 10:48.850
It's An's order.

10:49.030 --> 10:51.030
He said it's cargo for a merchant group.

10:51.120 --> 10:52.270
It's been checked already.

10:52.590 --> 10:53.430
Where's An?

10:53.730 --> 10:54.670
An?

10:55.590 --> 10:57.190
I don't know. I haven't seen him.

10:58.030 --> 10:58.830
Let's leave.

11:08.630 --> 11:10.270
So you're afraid of being found out too, huh?

11:12.230 --> 11:13.630
Neither of us are good people;

11:13.650 --> 11:14.820
no need to scare me.

11:38.110 --> 11:38.910
Who's used this water pouch

11:39.070 --> 11:40.550
these past few days?

11:45.110 --> 11:46.470
You haven't been spotted, have you?

11:47.430 --> 11:48.150
Do they all know

11:48.150 --> 11:49.350
I'm your fellow villager?

11:52.590 --> 11:53.670
Do I have some face?

11:56.630 --> 11:57.510
Yes, you do.

11:58.430 --> 11:59.630
Here, have some water.

12:03.110 --> 12:03.910
What's wrong?

12:07.150 --> 12:09.190
Do you remember I told you

12:09.750 --> 12:11.910
I came on board to find someone?

12:15.670 --> 12:16.720
That person

12:18.710 --> 12:20.110
used to be really good to me,

12:20.870 --> 12:21.910
so I always thought

12:21.910 --> 12:23.110
he was a good person.

12:23.790 --> 12:24.670
But later,

12:24.670 --> 12:26.310
some things happened,

12:26.910 --> 12:27.910
and I started to think

12:28.030 --> 12:29.600
maybe he wasn't so good after all.

12:31.390 --> 12:32.470
So what?

12:32.910 --> 12:33.710
So,

12:34.950 --> 12:35.950
I originally came to

12:35.950 --> 12:37.270
settle things with him,

12:37.590 --> 12:38.750
but then I noticed

12:39.070 --> 12:40.350
he seems to treat everyone else

12:40.350 --> 12:41.550
quite well.

12:42.230 --> 12:43.110
And then?

12:44.350 --> 12:45.190
Then,

12:46.110 --> 12:47.830
I got a bit confused.

12:49.150 --> 12:50.630
Is he a good person

12:51.030 --> 12:52.270
or a bad person?

12:54.310 --> 12:55.670
What's the big deal?

12:55.790 --> 12:57.230
People change.

12:59.710 --> 13:00.540
Someone

13:01.150 --> 13:02.230
might do good today

13:02.230 --> 13:03.550
and bad tomorrow.

13:03.590 --> 13:04.360
We can't say he's

13:04.360 --> 13:05.390
good today

13:05.390 --> 13:06.790
and bad tomorrow.

13:07.230 --> 13:08.220
You can't judge someone

13:08.220 --> 13:09.710
based on just one thing.

13:09.750 --> 13:11.470
It takes time to truly know someone's heart.

13:12.110 --> 13:13.030
Take me for example.

13:13.790 --> 13:14.630
You see me

13:14.920 --> 13:16.710
cheerful every day, right?

13:18.070 --> 13:19.470
But actually, I'm not

13:19.790 --> 13:20.950
very happy here either.

13:21.470 --> 13:22.750
If you're not happy,

13:22.910 --> 13:24.070
why don't you leave?

13:27.470 --> 13:28.910
My home is in Yandu,

13:29.390 --> 13:30.940
where it's already hard to make a living.

13:30.990 --> 13:32.230
Our house is small.

13:32.790 --> 13:34.030
After my elder brother got married

13:34.110 --> 13:35.260
and had a son,

13:35.510 --> 13:36.540
they're still all sleeping in one room

13:36.540 --> 13:38.150
even though my nephew's grown up now.

13:38.670 --> 13:40.790
My mom hopes I'll marry soon

13:40.790 --> 13:42.230
to free up space at home.

13:42.910 --> 13:44.190
So when the tower ship was hiring,

13:44.350 --> 13:45.310
I came here.

13:46.030 --> 13:48.550
Do you resent your family for that?

13:51.310 --> 13:52.270
I don't blame them.

13:52.440 --> 13:53.870
My sister-in-law always scolds my elder brother

13:53.870 --> 13:54.870
for being incompetent.

13:55.960 --> 13:57.350
My parents are in poor health,

13:57.590 --> 13:59.150
and he's the only one earning money.

13:59.590 --> 14:01.270
It's actually quite tough for him.

14:03.430 --> 14:05.030
Life is hard for everyone.

14:05.990 --> 14:07.710
The powerful have their struggles,

14:07.870 --> 14:08.910
and ordinary people

14:08.910 --> 14:10.390
have theirs too.

14:12.270 --> 14:13.070
Wait, that's not right.

14:13.660 --> 14:14.870
Aren't you my neighbor?

14:14.870 --> 14:16.470
How could you not know about my situation?

14:19.030 --> 14:20.750
Of course I know.

14:20.950 --> 14:21.600
I just

14:21.600 --> 14:22.950
didn't recall it for a moment.

14:25.820 --> 14:27.110
Here, have something to eat.

14:27.470 --> 14:29.230
I prepared it especially for you.

14:35.700 --> 14:36.580
It smells so good.

14:36.580 --> 14:37.350
Doesn't it?

14:42.830 --> 14:44.110
Once I

14:44.510 --> 14:46.030
find the right man,

14:46.550 --> 14:47.790
I'll have a home,

14:47.950 --> 14:49.590
and I won't work on the tower ship anymore.

14:50.590 --> 14:52.030
But with so many people on the ship,

14:52.270 --> 14:53.990
isn't there anyone you like?

14:55.200 --> 14:56.810
I guess the right one hasn't come yet.

15:00.830 --> 15:02.390
It's not like there's no one at all.

15:03.520 --> 15:06.280
Yesterday, a gentleman came on board.

15:07.780 --> 15:08.780
He's kind,

15:08.950 --> 15:10.150
good-looking,

15:10.940 --> 15:12.460
and I quite like him.

15:13.070 --> 15:14.310
What's so good about him?

15:15.550 --> 15:16.550
He's just good—

15:16.910 --> 15:17.830
friendly,

15:17.830 --> 15:18.790
helpful,

15:18.820 --> 15:20.500
and speaks in a gentle manner.

15:20.590 --> 15:21.910
I heard from Uncle Guan that

15:22.180 --> 15:23.380
last night

15:23.510 --> 15:24.790
he even read letters from home for the crew.

15:24.790 --> 15:25.710
He didn't charge them,

15:25.790 --> 15:26.840
and was very patient.

15:27.470 --> 15:29.110
But judging from his clothes and appearance,

15:29.150 --> 15:30.870
he's clearly from a wealthy family.

15:31.110 --> 15:32.510
He probably wouldn't fancy someone like me.

15:34.790 --> 15:36.790
It seems like I and Mr. Yuan

15:37.190 --> 15:38.630
just aren't meant to be.

15:39.670 --> 15:40.790
Mr. Yuan?

15:41.590 --> 15:42.510
Is his surname Yuan?

15:45.030 --> 15:45.830
Does he

15:47.150 --> 15:47.910
have an attendant

15:47.910 --> 15:49.110
with him?

15:49.630 --> 15:50.430
Yes, he does.

15:52.190 --> 15:53.950
His attendant is also very good-looking.

15:54.240 --> 15:55.030
Do you think

15:55.270 --> 15:57.070
I'd be a good match for that attendant?

16:03.830 --> 16:04.630
It's right there.

16:04.630 --> 16:05.950
We've searched the entire tower ship.

16:05.950 --> 16:06.630
Only this cabin

16:06.630 --> 16:07.460
refuses to let us in.

16:07.460 --> 16:08.710
I suspect the person is inside.

16:08.740 --> 16:09.550
Go knock on the door.

16:09.550 --> 16:10.590
What if he doesn't open it?

16:11.030 --> 16:11.950
Then we'll break it down.

16:11.950 --> 16:12.590
Yes.

16:17.710 --> 16:18.510
Is anyone there?

16:18.910 --> 16:20.190
We're the tower ship's guards.

16:20.320 --> 16:21.430
We have urgent business.

16:21.870 --> 16:22.830
Please open the door.

16:27.830 --> 16:29.150
What exactly happened?

16:29.830 --> 16:30.620
Here's the thing.

16:30.620 --> 16:31.550
A guest on the ship

16:31.550 --> 16:32.710
lost something valuable.

16:32.710 --> 16:33.960
I suspect there's a thief on board.

16:33.960 --> 16:35.350
You suspect I'm the thief?

16:36.630 --> 16:37.860
That's not what I meant at all.

16:37.860 --> 16:39.620
We just want to search around.

16:41.350 --> 16:42.350
Search around?

16:44.960 --> 16:46.390
This is Shen Ying's ship, isn't it?

16:46.550 --> 16:47.790
Let him come and search himself.

16:48.430 --> 16:49.230
No.

16:49.750 --> 16:50.550
He's so rude...

16:50.710 --> 16:51.670
He's Mr. Tanghua,

16:51.670 --> 16:52.750
from the Youhu Clan.

16:52.790 --> 16:55.030
Go!

16:55.060 --> 16:55.760
Go!

16:59.150 --> 17:02.830
Did you say Mr. Tanghua is on the ship?

17:07.060 --> 17:08.550
Is he here to chase the medicine?

17:08.790 --> 17:10.750
I don't think so.

17:13.869 --> 17:14.910
In any case,

17:15.109 --> 17:17.390
he's the Commander of the Youhu Clan's War Division.

17:18.030 --> 17:19.349
Since he's here,

17:19.819 --> 17:21.390
we should at least show some hospitality.

17:21.829 --> 17:22.630
Well,

17:23.069 --> 17:24.349
prepare some gifts

17:24.349 --> 17:25.430
and deliver them on my behalf.

17:25.710 --> 17:27.829
While you're at it, try to gauge his intentions.

17:28.950 --> 17:29.750
Yes.

17:38.950 --> 17:39.750
Tanyin,

17:40.230 --> 17:41.670
it's not that I don't agree,

17:41.710 --> 17:43.160
but you said yourself

17:43.160 --> 17:44.550
that he knows you.

17:44.710 --> 17:46.070
If you go over like this,

17:46.070 --> 17:47.910
won't you be recognized at a glance?

17:48.630 --> 17:49.470
Don't worry.

17:49.590 --> 17:50.670
I have my ways.

17:52.960 --> 17:53.870
What's this?

17:54.190 --> 17:55.350
It looks pretty nice.

17:55.430 --> 17:56.340
Bear with it for a moment.

17:59.910 --> 18:01.910
Why are you pinching me?

18:18.870 --> 18:19.670
Tanyin!

18:19.830 --> 18:20.710
You...

18:21.100 --> 18:23.230
How did you turn into me?

18:23.710 --> 18:25.150
I didn't turn into you.

18:25.310 --> 18:26.870
It's just an illusion.

18:26.990 --> 18:28.390
As long as I wear this,

18:28.500 --> 18:29.570
others will

18:29.600 --> 18:30.600
see me as you.

18:31.820 --> 18:33.090
So magical!

18:33.150 --> 18:34.910
Tanyin, have you become an immortal cultivator?

18:34.910 --> 18:35.830
Are you a cultivator?

18:35.830 --> 18:37.990
Is this magic?

18:38.590 --> 18:39.670
It's not magic,

18:40.510 --> 18:41.590
just a trick.

18:44.470 --> 18:45.510
But you can't touch it.

18:45.830 --> 18:46.790
If it gets rubbed off,

18:46.790 --> 18:47.870
it won't work anymore.

18:48.790 --> 18:49.900
Anyway, for now,

18:49.900 --> 18:51.350
you stay here and rest.

18:51.350 --> 18:52.750
I'll go out and work for you.

18:54.030 --> 18:55.100
What are you going to do?

18:56.750 --> 18:57.950
I want to see

18:58.670 --> 18:59.500
if he's really

18:59.500 --> 19:00.710
as helpful as you say.

19:06.100 --> 19:06.910
Sir.

19:07.710 --> 19:08.510
How did it go?

19:08.990 --> 19:10.390
Mr. Tanghua said

19:10.670 --> 19:11.550
he doesn't need to be served

19:11.550 --> 19:12.750
and doesn't want to be disturbed,

19:12.790 --> 19:14.020
so he sent me back.

19:16.870 --> 19:18.830
That's good.

19:21.430 --> 19:22.350
Why what?

19:23.310 --> 19:24.390
Why not stop you?

19:24.670 --> 19:25.990
Weren't you trying to save me?

19:26.340 --> 19:27.950
How could I ruin your plans?

19:29.540 --> 19:30.350
Tanghua,

19:31.710 --> 19:33.350
why are you still like this?

19:33.870 --> 19:35.830
If you're going to act, be decisive.

19:36.110 --> 19:38.230
If you're going to take a side, commit fully.

19:38.590 --> 19:40.100
How can you lead the War Division

19:40.100 --> 19:41.350
if you keep hesitating

19:41.630 --> 19:43.270
and wavering like this?

19:53.190 --> 19:53.870
Good morning, Xue.

19:53.870 --> 19:54.510
Morning.

19:55.100 --> 19:56.270
Xue, hurry up.

19:56.270 --> 19:57.230
Everyone's waiting for you.

19:57.230 --> 19:58.060
You're almost late.

19:58.060 --> 19:59.020
I know, thank you.

19:59.020 --> 19:59.790
Hurry up!

20:11.590 --> 20:12.270
Here.

20:15.300 --> 20:16.550
Such a small wound.

20:16.590 --> 20:17.510
Normally,

20:17.510 --> 20:19.160
the Divine Left Hand could heal it instantly.

20:20.060 --> 20:20.750
Yuanzhong,

20:21.840 --> 20:23.220
you're in for some serious bad luck.

20:23.780 --> 20:24.550
Ji Tanyin

20:24.550 --> 20:26.270
is definitely no ordinary War Demon.

20:26.620 --> 20:28.550
She must be someone of higher status

20:28.570 --> 20:30.440
than the leader of the War Demon.

20:30.870 --> 20:32.190
Higher than the clan leader?

20:33.190 --> 20:34.150
Who could that be?

20:35.220 --> 20:37.390
Maybe a saintess,

20:37.410 --> 20:39.490
or a priestess who communicates with the gods.

20:39.530 --> 20:40.570
Anyway, she's very powerful.

20:41.270 --> 20:42.070
Yuanzhong,

20:42.350 --> 20:44.230
killing her would be like killing a god.

20:44.230 --> 20:45.590
You'll be rejected by the heavenly way

20:45.800 --> 20:46.760
and face terrible misfortune.

20:48.000 --> 20:48.630
Those War Demons

20:48.630 --> 20:50.110
were expelled from the Divine Realm long ago.

20:50.250 --> 20:51.410
If they count as gods,

20:51.710 --> 20:53.230
then I've killed plenty of gods.

20:58.980 --> 20:59.790
Who is it?

21:00.510 --> 21:01.430
The meal delivery.

21:05.100 --> 21:06.500
What delicious food do we have today?

21:06.520 --> 21:08.160
You'll know when you open it.

21:09.030 --> 21:09.830
Come in.

21:12.470 --> 21:13.270
Put it here.

21:30.230 --> 21:31.790
How should I test him?

21:40.910 --> 21:42.270
Do you have any troubles

21:42.270 --> 21:43.100
that you need help with?

21:45.670 --> 21:46.590
Do you have letters from home?

21:46.740 --> 21:47.590
I can read them for you.

21:48.750 --> 21:49.550
Well,

21:49.990 --> 21:51.390
is there any work I can help you with?

21:56.150 --> 21:57.550
Just pick up

21:57.550 --> 21:58.640
the broken teacup pieces on the floor.

21:59.550 --> 22:00.350
Fine.

22:08.230 --> 22:09.950
Your hand is injured?

22:11.670 --> 22:12.470
It's nothing.

22:12.790 --> 22:13.580
Where should I put them?

22:18.750 --> 22:19.630
Put them here.

22:30.350 --> 22:31.110
Is there anything else

22:31.110 --> 22:32.200
you need help with?

22:32.550 --> 22:33.470
Why are you always

22:33.470 --> 22:34.670
so eager to help others?

22:37.510 --> 22:38.470
Doing a good deed every day

22:38.710 --> 22:40.100
is a requirement I set for myself.

22:44.500 --> 22:46.830
If there's nothing else, you can go now.

22:50.870 --> 22:53.020
Let go of my father!

22:53.490 --> 22:54.890
Don't touch my father!

22:54.990 --> 22:55.550
Miss Yu,

22:55.550 --> 22:56.190
Don't touch him!

22:56.190 --> 22:57.260
Your father has been dead for a while.

22:57.260 --> 22:58.310
You kept it hidden,

22:58.670 --> 22:59.550
but the other passengers in the cabin

22:59.550 --> 23:00.990
found out.

23:00.990 --> 23:02.390
Who wants to share a room

23:02.390 --> 23:03.440
with a dead body?

23:03.590 --> 23:05.110
Good thing you're in the sky.

23:05.110 --> 23:05.990
If this were on the land,

23:05.990 --> 23:07.470
you would've been thrown off the ship already.

23:07.470 --> 23:08.510
We're just

23:08.510 --> 23:10.160
moving him to the cargo hold.

23:10.160 --> 23:11.230
Is that not okay?

23:11.670 --> 23:13.480
I don't want to make things difficult for you,

23:13.750 --> 23:14.950
but the cargo hold

23:14.950 --> 23:16.870
is where you keep live chickens and ducks.

23:18.160 --> 23:19.800
It's filthy and chaotic.

23:19.850 --> 23:20.910
How can I let my father's body

23:20.910 --> 23:22.310
stay there?

23:22.990 --> 23:24.790
All the other cargo holds are full.

23:24.790 --> 23:26.630
Please try to understand our situation.

23:26.630 --> 23:28.200
Why are you wasting time talking to her?

23:28.200 --> 23:29.060
Just move him quickly.

23:29.230 --> 23:29.910
Aren't you afraid of bad luck?

23:29.910 --> 23:31.260
Move him to my cabin.

23:31.870 --> 23:33.070
I have a private cabin,

23:33.390 --> 23:34.430
and it won't bother anyone.

23:37.670 --> 23:38.550
Is that not okay?

23:39.110 --> 23:40.390
If you're willing,

23:40.390 --> 23:41.820
then there's no problem.

23:42.110 --> 23:43.160
Then bring him in.

23:44.950 --> 23:45.750
Take him away.

23:53.750 --> 23:55.270
Mr. Yuan is such a good man.

23:55.290 --> 23:56.850
Yesterday, he even read my family letters for me.

23:56.920 --> 23:58.390
Indeed, doing so many good deeds

23:58.390 --> 23:59.750
will surely bring him a long life.

24:01.290 --> 24:02.500
Thank you, Mr. Yuan.

24:02.990 --> 24:03.870
Thank you, Mr. Yuan.

24:03.870 --> 24:04.750
No need to be so polite.

24:04.820 --> 24:05.790
Please, rise quickly.

24:25.750 --> 24:28.160
So, you

24:29.270 --> 24:30.430
want to cooperate with me?

24:31.110 --> 24:31.910
Yes.

24:33.510 --> 24:35.270
Our goals don't conflict,

24:35.390 --> 24:37.030
and I can provide you with

24:37.030 --> 24:38.830
information about Mr. Yuan.

24:43.270 --> 24:44.390
Do you know who I am?

24:44.390 --> 24:45.590
I don't care who you are.

24:45.670 --> 24:47.260
As long as you don't interfere with our plans,

24:48.190 --> 24:49.870
you're not our enemy.

24:52.390 --> 24:53.190
Interesting.

24:55.680 --> 24:57.710
They say the human race is timid and cowardly,

24:58.750 --> 24:59.990
but you're different.

25:00.870 --> 25:01.670
Fine,

25:02.610 --> 25:05.000
then tell me everything

25:06.350 --> 25:09.200
about Mr. Yuan.

25:18.510 --> 25:19.300
Boss,

25:19.520 --> 25:21.120
could this guy mess things up?

25:22.230 --> 25:24.070
He said that Mr. Yuan

25:24.070 --> 25:25.190
is from the Youhu Clan.

25:25.310 --> 25:26.670
Knowing the other's identity,

25:26.670 --> 25:27.670
he still dares to act.

25:28.070 --> 25:29.390
He's got guts.

25:29.870 --> 25:30.880
So what should we do?

25:31.150 --> 25:32.750
Should we wait a bit longer?

25:33.430 --> 25:35.390
Maybe he can really succeed.

25:36.550 --> 25:37.830
Let him do his thing,

25:37.920 --> 25:39.350
and we'll do ours.

25:39.680 --> 25:41.110
Whether he succeeds or not,

25:41.470 --> 25:42.790
once the fire bomb goes off,

25:42.960 --> 25:43.920
everyone

25:44.150 --> 25:46.220
will head to the underworld.

25:46.220 --> 25:46.950
Well...

25:47.230 --> 25:49.110
There's an immortal from the Youhu Clan on this ship.

25:49.110 --> 25:50.310
Could something go wrong?

25:51.030 --> 25:52.950
So what if they're from the Youhu Clan?

25:53.270 --> 25:54.780
Do you really think they're gods?

25:54.890 --> 25:56.740
From this height, if they fall,

25:56.990 --> 25:58.510
they'll be lucky

25:58.510 --> 25:59.480
to save their own lives.

26:01.270 --> 26:02.710
Success or failure hinges on this moment.

26:03.190 --> 26:04.300
When the time comes,

26:05.200 --> 26:06.150
everyone

26:06.580 --> 26:08.460
will remember our names.

26:18.350 --> 26:19.270
You're back.

26:21.110 --> 26:23.150
Did you do all this?

26:23.910 --> 26:24.710
Yes, I did.

26:24.910 --> 26:26.060
When I'm in a good mood,

26:26.060 --> 26:27.190
I like to tidy up.

26:27.990 --> 26:28.870
Come, have a seat.

26:29.630 --> 26:31.150
That's a great habit.

26:32.580 --> 26:33.920
I'm exhausted.

26:34.780 --> 26:36.100
Are you particularly tired today?

26:37.290 --> 26:38.580
Well, it's the Sea Lantern Festival.

26:38.830 --> 26:39.710
Many guests

26:39.710 --> 26:40.660
took the ship

26:40.660 --> 26:41.820
for the holiday.

26:42.190 --> 26:43.510
So we had to decorate

26:43.510 --> 26:44.670
and clean everywhere.

26:44.700 --> 26:47.300
It's inevitable to feel a bit tired.

26:48.280 --> 26:49.650
What's the Sea Lantern Festival?

26:52.470 --> 26:53.260
You don't know?

27:02.120 --> 27:03.150
The Sea Lantern Festival?

27:03.230 --> 27:04.030
Yes.

27:04.850 --> 27:06.610
The Sea Lantern Festival is a holiday

27:06.640 --> 27:08.520
where the human race pray to the gods.

27:09.070 --> 27:10.310
Because this place is the highest

27:10.390 --> 27:11.910
and closest to the heavens,

27:12.230 --> 27:13.180
many people

27:13.220 --> 27:14.460
take this ship specifically

27:14.630 --> 27:16.720
to release lanterns.

27:17.540 --> 27:19.810
We believe that as long as we write our blessings

27:19.830 --> 27:21.270
on the lanterns

27:21.680 --> 27:22.830
and release them into the sky,

27:23.150 --> 27:24.710
the gods will hear

27:24.750 --> 27:25.830
our prayers

27:26.750 --> 27:28.430
and grant our wishes.

27:29.110 --> 27:31.310
We usually commemorate our departed loved ones

27:31.310 --> 27:32.830
on the day.

27:33.580 --> 27:34.900
During the Sea Lantern Festival,

27:34.920 --> 27:36.060
guests release lanterns

27:36.060 --> 27:37.870
filled with their blessings

27:37.870 --> 27:39.710
into the wind. They soar through the sky,

27:39.730 --> 27:41.470
nearly illuminating the entire night—

27:41.490 --> 27:43.370
a rare and breathtaking sight.

27:44.460 --> 27:46.660
I suppose the old man you mentioned

27:47.110 --> 27:48.350
came for this reason too.

27:48.550 --> 27:49.630
It's just a pity

27:49.910 --> 27:51.270
that he'll never see it again.

27:51.950 --> 27:52.750
But

27:53.950 --> 27:55.310
have you ever thought that

27:55.540 --> 27:56.350
maybe the gods

27:56.670 --> 27:57.710
don't actually hear

27:57.710 --> 27:58.750
your prayers at all?

27:59.010 --> 28:00.010
It doesn't matter.

28:00.030 --> 28:01.760
As long as we believe, that's enough.

28:21.110 --> 28:22.070
Take it slow.

28:41.270 --> 28:42.070
Go in.

28:43.470 --> 28:44.270
Go.

28:46.150 --> 28:46.950
Go.

28:48.710 --> 28:49.510
Go in.

28:53.870 --> 28:54.670
My friend!

28:56.670 --> 28:57.550
Who are you?

28:59.710 --> 29:01.550
You've been hard to find.

29:07.590 --> 29:08.390
Look at that one,

29:08.390 --> 29:09.160
so beautiful.

29:12.590 --> 29:14.190
It's flying, flying high!

29:14.370 --> 29:15.710
May the gods bless me

29:15.710 --> 29:17.030
to grow up quickly.

29:17.950 --> 29:19.440
It's flying, flying high!

29:19.990 --> 29:20.910
Be careful!

29:21.110 --> 29:21.910
Don't fall.

29:22.190 --> 29:23.230
I know.

29:23.230 --> 29:24.030
Go play.

29:35.310 --> 29:36.100
Miss,

29:36.540 --> 29:37.940
could you tell me how to get to the first-class cabins?

29:41.120 --> 29:42.000
What did you say?

29:48.550 --> 29:49.820
I... I was asking

29:50.260 --> 29:51.940
how to get to the first-class cabins.

29:53.150 --> 29:54.270
It's my first time on the ship,

29:54.270 --> 29:55.070
and after walking around a bit,

29:55.070 --> 29:56.550
I can't remember the way back.

29:58.680 --> 29:59.470
First-class cabins...

29:59.750 --> 30:00.880
Go upstairs from there,

30:01.070 --> 30:02.470
and you'll reach the first-class cabin.

30:04.210 --> 30:05.000
Wait.

30:06.510 --> 30:07.670
Is there anything else?

30:10.150 --> 30:11.180
I just wanted to say

30:12.950 --> 30:13.750
thank you.

30:19.270 --> 30:20.590
Who is the host inviting to the banquet

30:20.590 --> 30:22.030
at the Dragon Hall tonight?

30:22.150 --> 30:23.350
It's quite a grand affair.

30:23.580 --> 30:24.640
You don't know?

30:24.640 --> 30:26.030
It's an immortal from the Youhu Clan.

30:26.030 --> 30:26.820
An immortal?

30:26.820 --> 30:27.590
Really?

30:27.750 --> 30:28.790
Haven't you noticed

30:28.790 --> 30:29.870
what kind of person our host is?

30:30.270 --> 30:31.240
An ordinary person wouldn't deserve

30:31.240 --> 30:32.910
such careful and attentive treatment.

30:33.070 --> 30:33.750
I heard that person

30:33.750 --> 30:35.110
boarded at Hulu Port.

30:35.310 --> 30:36.030
Isn't Hulu Port

30:36.030 --> 30:37.400
very close to Fangwai Mountain?

30:37.590 --> 30:38.630
And I caught a glimpse of

30:38.630 --> 30:39.670
that young master from afar.

30:39.670 --> 30:41.390
He had an immortal aura—no mistake about it.

30:41.550 --> 30:42.350
Really?

31:13.950 --> 31:14.750
What's the matter?

31:17.540 --> 31:19.940
That father and daughter got off the ship

31:19.960 --> 31:21.440
at Xing'an Port at noon today.

31:21.750 --> 31:23.460
Miss Yu couldn't find you,

31:23.590 --> 31:24.830
so she asked me to pass on

31:24.830 --> 31:26.110
her gratitude to you.

31:30.000 --> 31:31.070
What's wrong with this lantern?

31:33.540 --> 31:34.570
Let me take a look.

31:39.470 --> 31:42.190
This thin string isn't just for decoration.

31:42.550 --> 31:43.870
You need to tie it tightly,

31:44.060 --> 31:44.870
or

31:44.870 --> 31:46.550
the hot air will escape from here.

31:46.550 --> 31:47.750
Without enough upward force,

31:47.990 --> 31:49.270
the lantern won't fly.

31:49.470 --> 31:51.070
Look, it's fixed now.

32:13.610 --> 32:14.770
Aren't you going to make a wish?

32:16.300 --> 32:17.350
When you release the lantern,

32:17.390 --> 32:18.670
you need to say your wish out loud

32:18.700 --> 32:19.990
so the gods can hear it

32:20.100 --> 32:21.650
and help make it come true.

32:24.590 --> 32:25.540
Can they hear it?

32:26.750 --> 32:27.950
I don't know about others,

32:28.350 --> 32:29.430
but if you make a wish,

32:29.430 --> 32:30.950
the gods will surely hear it.

32:34.230 --> 32:35.180
Make a wish.

32:38.030 --> 32:38.870
There's no need.

32:39.530 --> 32:40.480
I don't have any wishes.

32:42.190 --> 32:43.110
That can't be.

32:43.270 --> 32:44.710
Everyone has wishes.

32:45.780 --> 32:46.830
Do you have a wish?

32:47.350 --> 32:48.150
Yes, I do.

32:48.750 --> 32:49.710
I hope

32:50.640 --> 32:52.030
I can complete

32:52.110 --> 32:53.260
my mission

32:53.390 --> 32:54.190
smoothly, steadily,

32:54.190 --> 32:55.350
and with a clear conscience.

32:55.750 --> 32:57.680
I also hope for peace across the Six Realms,

32:57.990 --> 32:59.110
love in the world,

33:00.070 --> 33:01.590
and the endless cycle of life for all things.

33:03.790 --> 33:04.950
You're just a handmaiden,

33:05.700 --> 33:06.860
yet you think quite a lot.

33:53.150 --> 33:54.110
Mr. Tanghua,

33:55.100 --> 33:56.990
the banquet is ready.

33:57.110 --> 33:58.200
Let's take our seats.

34:07.230 --> 34:08.030
Look,

34:08.429 --> 34:09.389
there's a lantern

34:09.389 --> 34:10.670
that looks like a fish,

34:11.429 --> 34:12.699
and another like a butterfly.

34:13.190 --> 34:14.350
What does that one look like?

34:15.389 --> 34:16.219
A steamed bun?

34:19.989 --> 34:20.870
Why is your sea lantern

34:20.870 --> 34:22.270
so plain?

34:22.949 --> 34:23.870
I just bought anything.

34:24.670 --> 34:26.190
Let me make you a new one.

34:26.590 --> 34:27.909
I'm quite skilled.

34:28.070 --> 34:28.870
Do you have

34:28.870 --> 34:29.909
a style you like?

34:36.389 --> 34:37.590
Don't you believe me?

34:39.020 --> 34:41.179
I've been learning the craft from my teacher since I was a child.

34:41.420 --> 34:42.670
My teacher is very skilled at

34:42.670 --> 34:43.550
making lanterns.

34:43.800 --> 34:44.880
The sea lanterns he makes

34:44.909 --> 34:46.219
will never fall.

34:46.239 --> 34:47.350
They keep flying

34:47.350 --> 34:49.949
and can even cross the Sea of Flux,

34:49.949 --> 34:51.150
all the way to the Divine Realm.

34:52.300 --> 34:53.620
Have you been to the Divine Realm?

34:53.889 --> 34:55.440
How do you know your teacher's lanterns

34:55.469 --> 34:56.840
can fly through the Sea of Flux

34:56.909 --> 34:58.070
and reach the Divine Realm?

34:58.070 --> 34:58.960
Maybe they

34:58.990 --> 34:59.990
just burned up or fell somewhere

35:00.300 --> 35:02.140
out of sight,

35:02.170 --> 35:03.530
tumbling into a filthy ditch

35:03.630 --> 35:04.950
and shattering to pieces.

35:06.030 --> 35:07.350
Anyway, I just know.

35:16.990 --> 35:18.150
Take it back quickly!

35:18.270 --> 35:19.190
Be gentle!

35:19.350 --> 35:19.990
Useless.

35:19.990 --> 35:21.750
Its life is more precious than yours.

35:21.860 --> 35:22.490
Yes.

35:30.670 --> 35:31.460
Let's go.

35:38.390 --> 35:39.150
It's gone.

35:39.150 --> 35:40.270
You don't have to be afraid anymore.

35:40.870 --> 35:41.900
Why should I be afraid?

35:45.830 --> 35:47.300
You're a handmaiden on the tower ship?

35:48.500 --> 35:49.210
What's your name?

35:49.550 --> 35:50.350
Xue.

35:50.390 --> 35:51.540
How long have you been working here?

35:52.640 --> 35:53.720
Over two years.

35:53.870 --> 35:54.750
Then you must know the people and happenings

35:54.750 --> 35:56.000
on this ship pretty well?

35:57.990 --> 35:58.830
I guess so.

35:59.750 --> 36:00.540
Okay.

36:01.250 --> 36:02.100
Then let me ask you,

36:02.630 --> 36:03.510
who is the guest

36:03.510 --> 36:05.110
being entertained in the private room on the second floor over there?

36:10.560 --> 36:11.440
You don't know?

36:13.910 --> 36:14.500
Aren't you

36:14.500 --> 36:15.910
the handmaiden on the tower ship?

36:16.110 --> 36:16.770
Well...

36:17.190 --> 36:18.430
Even a handmaiden doesn't

36:18.430 --> 36:20.030
know everything.

36:20.310 --> 36:21.470
Look at how many people there are,

36:21.470 --> 36:22.710
and how big this tower ship is.

36:22.880 --> 36:23.990
I'm very busy every day,

36:24.010 --> 36:25.720
with so many things to do.

36:26.150 --> 36:27.540
I don't see you being busy.

36:28.510 --> 36:30.270
I'm just stealing a moment of leisure.

36:30.470 --> 36:32.070
I can't always be busy;

36:32.450 --> 36:33.600
I need to balance work and rest.

36:49.750 --> 36:51.060
Why do you keep following me?

36:51.870 --> 36:53.110
I'm not following you.

36:58.070 --> 36:58.870
Alright.

36:59.210 --> 37:00.770
I heard that you

37:01.030 --> 37:02.190
are generous and kind-hearted,

37:02.210 --> 37:03.530
and enjoy helping others.

37:03.590 --> 37:05.540
So I have a favor to ask.

37:06.310 --> 37:07.110
What is it?

37:07.820 --> 37:08.910
I want to follow you

37:08.940 --> 37:10.380
and be your personal handmaiden.

37:11.510 --> 37:12.950
Actually, here's the thing.

37:13.110 --> 37:14.510
My family lives in Yandu City,

37:14.510 --> 37:15.590
and it's hard to make a living there.

37:15.810 --> 37:16.660
After my elder brother

37:16.660 --> 37:18.230
got married and had children,

37:18.270 --> 37:19.430
our house became too small.

37:19.760 --> 37:20.910
So I thought of

37:20.910 --> 37:22.360
coming here to the tower ship to find work.

37:22.840 --> 37:23.870
But as you know,

37:23.870 --> 37:25.350
the tower ship is full of all kinds of people,

37:25.350 --> 37:26.390
and I don't get along well with them.

37:26.590 --> 37:28.980
So I wanted to find a kind,

37:29.010 --> 37:29.770
gentle,

37:29.800 --> 37:31.480
and easy-to-get-along-with master to serve.

37:31.950 --> 37:33.960
Coincidentally, you showed up.

37:33.980 --> 37:34.840
I've also heard

37:34.840 --> 37:35.890
that you are kind-hearted

37:35.990 --> 37:37.070
and treat laborers and servants

37:37.070 --> 37:38.270
all equally.

37:38.410 --> 37:39.810
So...

37:50.700 --> 37:51.730
Neither disguise

37:52.390 --> 37:53.470
nor illusion.

37:54.350 --> 37:55.230
Then what is it?

37:56.090 --> 37:57.360
What are you doing?

38:00.920 --> 38:02.260
You said your name is Xue, right?

38:02.810 --> 38:03.610
Yes.

38:03.790 --> 38:04.740
Do you also know craftsmanship?

38:05.790 --> 38:06.590
No, I don't.

38:06.790 --> 38:08.230
Then why do you know how to fix sea lanterns?

38:09.270 --> 38:10.070
Sea lanterns?

38:10.340 --> 38:11.860
Aren't they just lanterns?

38:12.300 --> 38:13.390
It's very simple.

38:13.410 --> 38:14.780
It has nothing to do with craftsmanship.

38:15.110 --> 38:16.310
Do you know Ji Tanyin?

38:16.350 --> 38:17.030
Who?

38:23.800 --> 38:25.150
Whatever your purpose is,

38:25.270 --> 38:26.300
stay away from me.

38:27.110 --> 38:28.750
I'm not a kind-hearted person,

38:28.930 --> 38:30.050
and I don't need a handmaiden.

38:31.840 --> 38:33.040
Don't follow me.

38:38.900 --> 38:40.340
He's quite alert.

38:44.740 --> 38:45.550
Watch out!

38:51.690 --> 38:52.660
Mr. Tanghua,

38:53.020 --> 38:53.810
please.

39:04.000 --> 39:05.680
I tried to visit the mountain

39:05.990 --> 39:07.110
several times recently

39:07.130 --> 39:08.850
but never had the chance to meet you.

39:09.480 --> 39:10.950
Who would have thought that leaving

39:10.970 --> 39:12.910
would finally make it happen?

39:13.590 --> 39:16.310
This is truly my luck.

39:16.970 --> 39:18.330
There are many affairs in the mountains

39:18.350 --> 39:19.750
that require my personal attention,

39:19.890 --> 39:21.400
so I couldn't fulfill my duties as a host.

39:21.430 --> 39:22.840
Please don't blame me, Mr. Shen.

39:23.940 --> 39:26.190
Mr. Tanghua, you're too polite.

39:26.470 --> 39:28.310
As a leading figure among the immortal race,

39:28.360 --> 39:30.200
responsible for the safety of the world,

39:30.430 --> 39:31.710
you're bound to be busy.

39:33.000 --> 39:33.990
But no matter how busy you are,

39:34.160 --> 39:36.280
you must find time to rest.

39:36.750 --> 39:38.990
Now that the world is at peace

39:39.220 --> 39:41.030
and the people live and work in contentment,

39:41.390 --> 39:43.430
it's all the merit of the Youhu Clan

39:43.530 --> 39:45.370
and you.

39:46.350 --> 39:47.350
I know

39:47.690 --> 39:50.180
that immortals are compassionate

39:50.600 --> 39:52.350
and care deeply for the people.

39:53.360 --> 39:54.660
But to truly transcend the world,

39:55.310 --> 39:56.550
one must first engage with it.

39:57.030 --> 39:58.170
Isn't it a waste

39:58.510 --> 39:59.960
of this beautiful world

39:59.960 --> 40:01.190
to focus solely on arduous cultivation?

40:02.430 --> 40:04.030
Sir, look,

40:04.670 --> 40:05.950
the full moon hangs in the sky.

40:06.100 --> 40:08.070
We soar through the clouds,

40:08.760 --> 40:09.870
raising our toasts to the moon

40:10.230 --> 40:11.590
and enjoying wine and conversation.

40:11.910 --> 40:13.030
Isn't this kind of ease

40:13.100 --> 40:15.620
also a great life?

40:17.270 --> 40:18.630
Mr. Shen, you have a silver tongue.

40:19.170 --> 40:20.100
You are right.

40:20.620 --> 40:22.670
Peace across the land and the people living in contentment

40:22.910 --> 40:24.430
is indeed a great life.

40:29.630 --> 40:30.430
It's just a pity that

40:30.590 --> 40:31.750
such good days

40:31.820 --> 40:33.180
may not last long.

40:35.030 --> 40:36.040
Everyone knows that

40:36.270 --> 40:37.070
the Youhu Clan

40:37.070 --> 40:38.950
is descended from the spirit foxes of Fangwai Mountain.

40:39.470 --> 40:40.910
But the War Demon is different.

40:41.270 --> 40:42.620
They come from the Divine Realm,

40:42.700 --> 40:43.780
and have always taken pride in this

40:43.950 --> 40:45.510
for thousands of years.

40:46.970 --> 40:48.410
But Mr. Shen, do you know

40:48.990 --> 40:50.660
why these descendants of the divine race

40:50.870 --> 40:52.310
came to the mortal world?

40:54.230 --> 40:55.030
Well...

40:56.370 --> 40:57.420
I don't know.

40:59.430 --> 41:00.430
Legend has it that the War Demon

41:00.430 --> 41:02.100
once committed an unforgivable crime

41:02.270 --> 41:03.910
and were exiled to the mortal world as a whole clan.

41:04.350 --> 41:06.350
But after all, they are of divine race descent—

41:06.550 --> 41:08.430
invulnerable to blades and fire.

41:08.750 --> 41:10.630
Thus, the War Demons are incredibly powerful in battle,

41:10.940 --> 41:13.100
often able to fight one against a hundred.

41:13.460 --> 41:14.750
During the Battle of Pinghu back then,

41:15.350 --> 41:17.310
our clan suffered heavy losses because of this.

41:17.880 --> 41:20.400
Fortunately, the High Priest was talented,

41:20.510 --> 41:23.030
turned the tide and annihilated the War Demon

41:23.050 --> 41:24.770
with the power of Divine Hand.

41:25.590 --> 41:27.230
But the War Demons were not completely wiped out.

41:27.830 --> 41:28.830
A few days ago,

41:29.150 --> 41:29.870
sorcery descended

41:29.870 --> 41:31.450
upon Fangwai Mountain,

41:31.480 --> 41:32.910
and I saw it with my own eyes.

41:34.150 --> 41:35.190
Mr. Shen, you've sent so many

41:35.190 --> 41:36.590
handmaidens from the human race up the mountain.

41:37.000 --> 41:37.910
Haven't you heard even

41:37.910 --> 41:38.990
a whisper about it?

41:41.340 --> 41:42.220
Sir,

41:42.630 --> 41:44.270
you must be mistaken.

41:45.620 --> 41:47.310
Our clan sent handmaidens up the mountain

41:47.310 --> 41:48.910
to express our admiration,

41:49.030 --> 41:51.030
and gratitude for the Youhu Clan's kindness.

41:51.750 --> 41:53.470
The handmaidens who went up the mountain

41:53.870 --> 41:55.790
have no connection to us.

41:56.270 --> 41:57.660
Mr. Shen, no need to be nervous.

41:58.100 --> 41:59.550
I came here to meet you

41:59.750 --> 42:01.310
to ask for an important favor.

42:01.470 --> 42:02.830
Since the Battle of Pinghu,

42:03.150 --> 42:05.310
our clan has been tracking the remnants of the War Demons,

42:05.550 --> 42:06.350
but they've seemed

42:06.350 --> 42:07.710
vanished without a trace,

42:07.920 --> 42:09.910
leaving us searching in vain.

42:10.710 --> 42:12.510
Now that they dare to return,

42:13.060 --> 42:14.870
they must have some backing.

42:16.870 --> 42:18.990
Our two clans have always been closely connected.

42:19.590 --> 42:21.670
I hope we can join hands once again

42:21.830 --> 42:22.990
and face this together.

42:23.430 --> 42:24.310
The War Demons

42:24.550 --> 42:26.270
are our common enemy.

42:28.140 --> 42:29.920
But this matter is too significant

42:30.310 --> 42:31.830
for a mere envoy like me

42:31.830 --> 42:33.390
to decide.

42:34.190 --> 42:35.180
Rest assured, Sir.

42:35.360 --> 42:36.650
I will report this

42:36.680 --> 42:38.880
to the City Lord as soon as possible.

42:40.630 --> 42:41.430
Later,

42:41.800 --> 42:43.680
I will personally go to Yandu

42:44.240 --> 42:45.480
to meet with the City Lord

42:45.710 --> 42:47.350
and discuss this matter with him.
